Package: malariarct
Title: Malaria RCT Tracker
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("P.", "Winskill", email = "p.winskill@imperial.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Weekly scan for new malaria randomized controlled trials across
    PubMed, ClinicalTrials.gov and Europe PMC. Deduplicates hits across sources
    and identifiers, extracts a structured record for each trial (rules- or
    LLM-based), and maintains a growing dataset plus a human-readable brief.
    Designed to run unattended in GitHub Actions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    xml2,
    yaml,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
